{"id":"011f2e5e7950e938","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-core-model.md","title":"Core Model","display":"df-core-model — Core Model","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-core-model","aliases":["58-df-core-model","Core Model"],"display":"df-core-model — Core Model","depends_on":["[[58-df-zfc-inner-core-model-k]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-core-model"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-core-model</span><span>Core Model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-core-model — Core Model"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b78f1aa00040ca7f\" href=\"?note=b78f1aa00040ca7f\" title=\"58-df-zfc-inner-core-model-k\">58-df-zfc-inner-core-model-k</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> (set code for a core-model candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CoreModel}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{CoreModel}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\)</span> (metalinguistic core-model-code predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInnerCoreModelK}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInnerCoreModelK}_S\\)</span> (upstream fine-structural specification whose comparison relation is explicitly metatheoretic, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b78f1aa00040ca7f\" href=\"?note=b78f1aa00040ca7f\" title=\"58-df-zfc-inner-core-model-k\">58-df-zfc-inner-core-model-k</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{meta}\">\\(\\mathrm{meta}\\)</span> (metalinguistic marker)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}core\\text{-}model} \\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}} \\mathrm{CoreModel}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(K)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcInnerCoreModelK}_S(K)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}core\\text{-}model} \\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}} \\mathrm{CoreModel}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(K)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcInnerCoreModelK}_S(K)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This atom aliases the dedicated fine-structural universal core-model predicate.</li>\n<li>The existence range of a particular construction of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span>, its iterability, and covering properties require separate anti-large-cardinal hypotheses and are not built into this definition.</li>\n<li>The upstream comparison <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\preccurlyeq_{\\mathrm c}\">\\(\\preccurlyeq_{\\mathrm c}\\)</span> is declared metatheoretic, so this wrapper does not relabel the resulting specification as an ordinary first-order ZFC predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Steel, The Core Model Iterability Problem</li>\n<li>Jensen and Steel, K without the Measurable</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-zfc-inner-core-model-k","status":"resolved","id":"b78f1aa00040ca7f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-inner-core-model-k]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-inner-core-model-k","status":"resolved","id":"b78f1aa00040ca7f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcInnerCoreModelK}_S$ (upstream fine-structural specification whose comparison relation is explicitly metatheoretic, see [[58-df-zfc-inner-core-model-k]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CoreModel}_{\\mathrm{meta}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcInnerCoreModelK}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{meta}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}core\\text{-}model} \\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}} \\mathrm{CoreModel}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(K)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcInnerCoreModelK}_S(K)","display":true},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"\\preccurlyeq_{\\mathrm c}","display":false}],"bytes":1361,"backlinks":[{"id":"baa9f2ada6bcef62","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-372","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-core-model.md|58-df-core-model]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["b78f1aa00040ca7f"]}